              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In many cities, young people cannot afford to buy or rent a home. What are the causes of this problem, and what measures could be taken to solve it?",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
